  "description": "Cold-blooded, solitary, personality disordered, chaebol... and obsessive, the epitome of an obsessive maniac Ji Tae-Gwang. That very man suddenly becomes the butler to a cat that appeared out of nowhere?! Are you really the Ji Tae-Gwang I knew...?\n\nThe chaotic daily life story of an obsessive maniac who falls from grace to become a butler.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
